# Exact USBPORT.SYS exports imported by xhci98.sys.
#
# These names were verified against NUSB 5.00.2195.5652, Windows 2000 SP4
# 5.00.2195.6681, and Windows XP SP3 5.1.2600.5512. The generator compares
# this list with usbport-stub.def on every run, and additionally against a
# reference usbport.sys's dumpbin export table whenever one is available.
#
# THIS FILE IS THE SINGLE SOURCE for the USBPORT.SYS half of the driver's
# import surface. The post-link import gate (roadmap Phase 3 task 5) must
# *read* it for its USBPORT.SYS module row rather than restate the names -
# a third hand-maintained copy is how the three lists silently diverge.
# Adding a name here means the driver may import it; it does not by itself
# make anything import it.
#
# One name per line; # comments and blank lines ignored; matching is exact
# and case-sensitive.
USBPORT_GetHciMn
USBPORT_RegisterUSBPortDriver
